Third-party data used to train and validate the algorithms
----------------------------------------------------------
The packaged models (algorithms/ppg/caseback_ppg/models/scorer.json, algorithms/wellness/caseback_wellness/models/*.json)
were fitted on the datasets below.
The datasets are downloaded by the evaluation tools and are not redistributed in this repository. Each is used under
its own licence; attribution is required.

* BIDMC PPG and Respiration Dataset, PhysioNet, ODC-By 1.0.
  Pimentel M.A.F. et al., "Toward a robust estimation of respiratory rate from pulse oximeters", IEEE Transactions on
  Biomedical Engineering 64(8):1914-1923, 2017. Goldberger A.L. et al., PhysioBank, PhysioToolkit, and PhysioNet,
  Circulation 101(23):e215-e220, 2000. https://physionet.org/content/bidmc/1.0.0/
* IEEE Signal Processing Cup 2015 wrist PPG (TROIKA), Monash/Zenodo release, CC-BY-4.0.
  Zhang Z., Pi Z., Liu B., IEEE Transactions on Biomedical Engineering 62(2):522-531, 2015.
  https://zenodo.org/records/3902710 (the original competition terms have not been checked separately)
* PPG-DaLiA, Zenodo, CC-BY-4.0. Reiss A. et al., "Deep PPG: large-scale heart rate estimation with convolutional
  neural networks", Sensors 19(14):3079, 2019. https://zenodo.org/records/3902728
* OxWalk, University of Oxford, CC-BY. Small et al., DOI 10.5287/bodleian:ORQ2abnbR.
* Apple Watch motion and heart rate with polysomnography labels (Walch et al.), PhysioNet, ODC-By 1.0.
  Walch O., Huang Y., Forger D., Goldstein C., "Sleep stage prediction with raw acceleration and photoplethysmography
  heart rate data derived from a consumer wearable device", Sleep 42(12):zsz180, 2019.
  https://physionet.org/content/sleep-accel/1.0.0/

